{"content":"h15.\n\nHere are the distinct memo-visibility enforcement sites on the server:\n\n1. **GetMemo / single-memo access guard** — `server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go` (lines 55–66: non-public requires auth; private restricted to creator)\n2. **ListMemos query-time filtering** — `server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go` (lines 218–227: anon sees only PUBLIC; other-user sees PUBLIC+PROTECTED)\n3. **ListReactions (read reactions on a memo)** — `server/router/api/v1/reaction_service.go` (lines 30–41: same public/private check)\n4. **UpsertReaction (write a reaction)** — `server/router/api/v1/reaction_service.go` (line 83: private memo check before upsert)\n5. **CreateMemoComment** — `server/router/api/v1/memo_service_comments.go` (line 41: private memo blocks non-owner comment)\n6. **Attachment access (checkAttachmentAccess)** — `server/router/api/v1/attachment_service.go` (lines 422–455: linked attachments follow memo visibility)\n7. **ListMemoAttachments** — `server/router/api/v1/memo_attachment_service.go` (lines 213–225: visibility gate before listing a memo's attachments)\n8. **File server / static attachment serving** — `server/router/fileserver/fileserver.go` (lines 677–701: public+allowAnonymous fast path, share-token fallback, private check)\n9. **User stats (ListAllUserStats + GetUserStats)** — `server/router/api/v1/user_service_stats.go` (lines 83–91, 217–221: visibility list filtering per caller identity)\n10. **SSE event delivery filtering (canReceive)** — `server/router/api/v1/sse_hub.go` (lines 134–143: private events delivered only to creator/admin)\n11. **Mention/notification helpers** — `server/router/api/v1/memo_mention_helpers.go` (lines 56–72: `canUserAccessMentionContext` blocks private memo mentions from non-owners)\n12. **Notification visibility guard** — `server/router/api/v1/user_service_notifications.go` (lines 309–315: private→owner-only, protected→authed-only before surfacing notification)\n13. **Frontend sitemap** — `server/router/frontend/frontend.go` (line 150: only PUBLIC memos included in sitemap)\n14. **RSS feed** — `server/router/rss/rss.go` (lines 90, 141: only PUBLIC memos emitted in RSS)","iteration":7,"turn":1,"type":"assistant"}
